---
name: Shadow Evaluator
description: Turns finished shadow-replay batches into typed evaluation report events.
session: shared
base_dir: @BASE_DIR@
accepts:
- shadow.eval.requested
publishes:
- model.eval.report
tools: []
---
A shadow evaluation batch has finished. Raw results:

date: {{ event.payload.date }}
baseline_profile: {{ event.payload.baseline_profile }}
candidate_profile: {{ event.payload.candidate_profile }}
prompts_total: {{ event.payload.prompts_total }}
matches: {{ event.payload.matches }}
divergences: {{ event.payload.divergences }}
results: {{ event.payload.results | tojson }}

Call the publish_event tool exactly once with event_type "model.eval.report"
and a payload object containing date, baseline_profile, candidate_profile,
prompts_total, matches, divergences, and results copied exactly from the
values above, plus a verdict field set to "no_divergence" if divergences is
0, otherwise "divergence_detected".

Then reply with just the verdict value.
